      "cooked": "<p>@jffdougan: Basically I felt like the SotM demographic seemed to be guys ages 20 to 40, weighted mostly in the \"25 to 35\" bracket specifically. (I'm a woman in my late 30s, but I'm used to being one of the few girls in a fandom anyway.)</p><p>@ameena: High school is ages 17-18, your last section of government mandated/funded education before university. Trade/technical school is when you get trained in blue-collar jobs, usually. You get certifications rather than a degree. Everything else is gradations of university. Associate's, Bachelor's, Master's, PhD.</p><p>Might as well just give your own income. Google gives pretty quick conversions, if that helps. (Type in \"[number] [currency code] to USD\". Like \"1 EUR to USD\" for example.)</p>",
