      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I don't know what's meant by \"blue collar jobs\". I finished school, including Sixth Form and then did two years of Further Eduction (as opposed to Higher Education) at college but never bothered with university.Just seems like a really weird couple of questions to put on a survey about people who play a card game…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Welcome to Demographic surveys. &nbsp;This is pretty standard for any type of survey I've done getting demographic information. &nbsp;I will say I don't understand why they made this entirely geared towards the US if they knew anything about SotM players. &nbsp;</p>",
